<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective Feb 20.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     23.29     22.55	  4.66-9.89  5.03-10.26</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     23.29     22.55	  4.46-9.46  4.84-9.83</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     25.66     25.66	  12.44	12.44</p>
<p> White sugar	  25.66     25.66	  7.88	 7.88</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.26	0.26	  0.39</p>
<p>	 0.39</p>
</text>
